    <h2 id="section-5">Relationships</h2>
    <p>TODO</p>

    <h2 id="section-6">Trivia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>His handwriting is surprisingly neat, almost calligraphic, despite his otherwise rough, practical nature.</li>
      <li>He has a quiet fondness for late-night radio shows and sometimes leaves them playing softly while he works.</li>
      <li>Though he dislikes bright artificial lighting, he owns several lanterns and candles, claiming they "make the dark feel friendlier."</li>
      <li>He rarely finishes a sketchbook, often abandoning it halfway once he feels it's "served its purpose."</li>
      <li>Azzy painted a mural of Zeke near his old station around the time of his retirement, leaving a quiet tribute to his work, despite being short-lived.</li>
      <li>He claims he "cooks too much by accident," though anyone close to him knows it isn't really an accident.</li>
    </ul>
    <br/>
  </main>
</div>
</BaseLayout>








